    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds Address Types" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Address Type</p>
            <p>Adds a new address type using faker-generated mapping reference</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Static name/code, faker-generated mappingReference</p>
            <step>Step 1: Visit Address Types settings page</step>
            <step>Step 2: Click 'Add' button</step>
            <step>Step 3: Fill in name, code, mapping reference and select regulation group</step>
            <step>Step 4: Click 'Save'</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Confirmation message "Address Type has been added." is shown</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
